  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Bangladesh will implement the Initiation Plan for Sustainable Financing from November 15, 2024, to 14 May  2026. The Sustainable Financing is an initiative for advancing UNDP Bangladesh&#x2019;s work on sustainable financing across the key government agencies and non-government organizations to channel more financing for achieving the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) in Bangladesh. This IP will be instrumental in updating and institutionalizing processes to integrate climate considerations in</narrative>
  </description>
